*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "KNUPIM602.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Knup"
*Product: "(KP-IM602)"
*ModelName: "Knup KP-IM602 80mm"
*ShortNickName: "Knup KP-IM602 80mm"
*NickName: "Knup KP-IM602 80mm (POS-80C)"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Printer;MDL:POS-80C;CMD:ESC/POS;"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 1.4
*cupsModelNumber: 602
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 /Library/Printers/Knup/Filter/rastertoim602"

*% ===== Tamanho do papel =====
*% Largura util de 72 mm (576 pontos a 203 dpi), igual ao driver Windows.
*% "Rolo continuo" e o padrao do Windows: pagina bem comprida, e o espaco
*% em branco do fim e removido automaticamente antes do corte.
*OpenUI *PageSize/Papel: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Rolo80
*PageSize Rolo80/80mm - Rolo continuo: "<</PageSize[204 9286]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize X80Y297/80mm x 297mm: "<</PageSize[204 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize X80Y200/80mm x 200mm: "<</PageSize[204 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize X80Y150/80mm x 150mm: "<</PageSize[204 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize X80Y100/80mm x 100mm: "<</PageSize[204 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Rolo80
*PageRegion Rolo80/80mm - Rolo continuo: "<</PageSize[204 9286]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion X80Y297/80mm x 297mm: "<</PageSize[204 842]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion X80Y200/80mm x 200mm: "<</PageSize[204 567]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion X80Y150/80mm x 150mm: "<</PageSize[204 425]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion X80Y100/80mm x 100mm: "<</PageSize[204 283]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Rolo80
*ImageableArea Rolo80: "0 0 204 9286"
*ImageableArea X80Y297: "0 0 204 842"
*ImageableArea X80Y200: "0 0 204 567"
*ImageableArea X80Y150: "0 0 204 425"
*ImageableArea X80Y100: "0 0 204 283"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Rolo80
*PaperDimension Rolo80: "204 9286"
*PaperDimension X80Y297: "204 842"
*PaperDimension X80Y200: "204 567"
*PaperDimension X80Y150: "204 425"
*PaperDimension X80Y100: "204 283"

*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: "204"
*MaxMediaHeight: "9286"
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 100 204
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 100 9286
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0

*% ===== Resolucao e cor (igual POS80.GPD: 203x203 dpi, monocromatico) =====
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolucao: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 dpi: "<</HWResolution[203 203]/cupsBitsPerColor 8/cupsRowCount 0/cupsRowFeed 0/cupsRowStep 0/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsColorOrder 0>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Cor: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: Gray
*ColorModel Gray/Preto e branco: "<</cupsColorOrder 0/cupsColorSpace 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*% ===== Opcoes da impressora (lidas pelo filtro) =====
*OpenUI *IMCorte/Cortar papel: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *IMCorte
*DefaultIMCorte: Pagina
*IMCorte Pagina/Depois de cada pagina: ""
*IMCorte Fim/So no fim do trabalho: ""
*IMCorte Nao/Nao cortar: ""
*CloseUI: *IMCorte

*OpenUI *IMAvanco/Avanco antes do corte: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *IMAvanco
*DefaultIMAvanco: 15
*IMAvanco 0/0 mm: ""
*IMAvanco 5/5 mm: ""
*IMAvanco 10/10 mm: ""
*IMAvanco 15/15 mm: ""
*IMAvanco 20/20 mm: ""
*IMAvanco 30/30 mm: ""
*CloseUI: *IMAvanco

*OpenUI *IMAparar/Remover espaco em branco: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *IMAparar
*DefaultIMAparar: Sim
*IMAparar Sim/Sim (economiza papel): ""
*IMAparar Nao/Nao: ""
*CloseUI: *IMAparar

*OpenUI *IMModo/Tipo de conteudo: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *IMModo
*DefaultIMModo: Texto
*IMModo Texto/Texto e notas (nitido): ""
*IMModo Foto/Fotos e logos (pontilhado): ""
*CloseUI: *IMModo

*OpenUI *IMEscuro/Escuridao: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *IMEscuro
*DefaultIMEscuro: Normal
*IMEscuro Claro/Claro: ""
*IMEscuro Normal/Normal: ""
*IMEscuro Escuro/Escuro: ""
*IMEscuro MuitoEscuro/Muito escuro: ""
*CloseUI: *IMEscuro

*OpenUI *IMGaveta/Abrir gaveta: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *IMGaveta
*DefaultIMGaveta: Nao
*IMGaveta Nao/Nao: ""
*IMGaveta Sim/Sim, antes de imprimir: ""
*CloseUI: *IMGaveta

*OpenUI *IMBipe/Bipar no fim: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *IMBipe
*DefaultIMBipe: Nao
*IMBipe Nao/Nao: ""
*IMBipe Sim/Sim: ""
*CloseUI: *IMBipe

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
